[I] C++ implementation of the Google logging module

[T] Google Logging (glog) is a C++14 library that implements
[T] application-level logging. It provides logging APIs based on C++-style
[T] streams, severity levels, conditional logging and various helper macros.

[U] https://github.com/google/glog

[A] Glog Authors
